<title>POLAND: Polish dwellings output falls 50.3 pct m/m in July.</title>
<headline>Polish dwellings output falls 50.3 pct m/m in July.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of dwellings completed in July fell 50.3 percent from June and was 26.0 percent lower than in July 1996, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said 3,305 flats were completed in July bringing the total for the January-July period to 30,881 flats.</p>
<p> POLISH HOUSING OUTPUT	   July	June	  July 1996</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)     -50.3	 71.3	    na</p>
<p> number of flats built	   3,305    6,648(4,768)  4,466</p>
<p>NOTE - Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
